r print.png", "id": "246912787875696", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031311_246912791209029_5540108180063733703_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VIVtUJH2eR4Q7kNvwFaEB2E&_nc_oc=AdqVfjyj7jabA9TzX4ygtHRZ0TTlfIdiz-koJgtBeHvpgwYyY8X0OFqCtahYVn3INBw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQMMKwWfweNuYcqu1NmesO33VrcHhIdV4PZriVs-Ize3w&oe=6AF5CFEE"}, {"file_name": "Print 3.png", "id": "2170405556482566", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572950_2170405559815899_5420058398011207589_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JbChDU14-osQ7kNvwGflklV&_nc_oc=AdogA3Gztr_bGCINQDiCXYAPSWmvjb5NGfblaiwMgAkxLGpZiVnDRJ8YRv8-hY_jQls&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQyz3SqjV3bAltlJqkasjQupj_2a6KlT0hYWrQDRBi4Qw&oe=6AF5E1AF"}, {"file_name": "Print 5.png", "id": "921050275807580", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974548_921050279140913_846272164452751718_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=roqw2JOw7SwQ7kNvwE0FUEP&_nc_oc=Adq9v6KpeXnTQH6eBj_hMsAHeFHDLaY2f-yad74_8b7EpPtXXnO9-njoIx6gxQ84Dpc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRWS3WW0twCAlJJIRj9ztpOeObuiyjtH_0-2lPUf42ccw&oe=6AF5D497"}, {"file_name": "Print 2.png", "id": "1288706015050300", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_1288706018383633_3836298053771559642_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mh9WWF6jFr0Q7kNvwHuTN9A&_nc_oc=Adpzh8CMVeLqufJF_09J5ecaYcK7vVsTt75LyHipPSpVE9t9ydjyX28IUxyZpdcJT5Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTdmI33P01lu8leiv76mqh4MVKKo4TMl90sbi0yOYnltQ&oe=6AF5DE51"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Final v.0.1 (eeve).png", "id": "945385240225978", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974721_945385243559311_50820886768660782_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A-jDP0F-egIQ7kNvwGffjLU&_nc_oc=AdrWWNI-ML40DIRJP74UB2qntZNKE3zZR-ZZQMvz4WwHqgukUYlKgqJZjBlgVZNKIjw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTE5g4RrAfF7vLlpawho-HCbHdLkH00tu3GyRNA_l3Ywg&oe=6AF5E3FC"}, "display_name": "My Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "My Room is the game experience that allows you to interact with your friends and also create your own world.\n\nCustomize your character and explore our two game modes: Playground & My Room.\n\nIn the Playground you will find yourself in a multiplayer environment surrounded by minigames that are available to play with others. These games include:\n- Soccer: score as many goals as you can\n- Air Hockey (Arcade): play with the AI or with another player\n- Basketball (Arcade): throw the balls and try to score points\n- Cornhole (Arcade): have fun trying to score as you play with the bean bags\n- Darts (Arcade): practice your aiming in the available stations\n- Mini Golf (Arcade): try to aim the hole at the mini golf courses\nThe multiplayer also includes voice/text chat for you to communicate with other players\n\nWhen in My Room, you will be able to customize your own space. You can choose between 3 different themed templates, explore and change it the way you prefer.\n\n* Find more information about the gameplay itself the app*\n\nUpcoming updates in the near future:\n- Game monetary system\n- Shop\n- More games\n- More rooms\n\nHave fun!", "short_description": "Play minigames along with your friends in a multiplayer environment or explore and customize your own room with this experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "VResearch Lab", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "ex